{
 "bank": "05",
 "sections": {
  "Ptrs05BD17": {
   "name": "Layer 2 scroll sprites: init and shared setup",
   "summary": [
    "Init routines for the level's scroll sprites (auto-scroll, layer 2 scroll/smash/falls etc.), run when a scroll sprite is started.",
    "$05BD0E: if [$143F] (layer 2 scroll sprite number) is non-zero, dispatches through the pointer table at $05BD17 (indexed by [$143F]).",
    "$05BD36 etc.: pick the layer's command from [$1440]/[$1441] (layer 1/2) and its parameters from tables, then clear the scroll words.",
    "[$1456] selects the layer (0 = layer 1, 4 = layer 2). Several entries are unused leftovers. Meaning of $1442-$1454 is hedged.",
    "$05BFD2: common reset (A = scroll sprite number); $05BFF6: Layer 2 On/Off Switch init."
   ]
  },
  "s05BFFD": {
   "name": "Unused data"
  }
 },
